{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/logical.indian/videos/fact-check-cropped-screenshot-of-the-wire-article-shared-claiming-the-platform-d/365299337857262/?locale=zh_CN","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/logical.indian/videos/fact-check-cropped-screenshot-of-the-wire-article-shared-claiming-the-platform-d/365299337857262/?locale=zh_CN","title":"2,441 次播放 · 16 个心情 | Screenshot of a part of an old article published in The Wire has been shared with the context that the organisation tried to demean Goddess Durga. | The Logical Indian","description":"Screenshot of a part of an old article published in The Wire has been shared with the context that the organisation tried to demean Goddess Durga.","language":"zh","text":"A video showing passengers with confirmed AC tickets pulling a train's emergency chain after ticketless travellers allegedly occupied their coach has sparked fresh debate over overcrowding and passenger rights. The incident highlights the frustration of reserved passengers who expect the seating and comfort they have paid for.\nReserved Seats, Denied Comfort\n👉🏽 The dispute reportedly arose when ticketless travellers occupied space inside a reserved AC coach, leaving confirmed ticket holders frustrated. Passengers eventually pulled the emergency chain, bringing the train to a halt. No official statement or details of disciplinary action have been confirmed in the information available.\nA Recurring Concern\n👉🏽 Overcrowding and unauthorised entry into reserved coaches remain concerns for railway passengers. Such situations raise questions about ticket checks, crowd management and the enforcement of reservation rules.\n⚡⚡How can Indian Railways ensure reserved coaches remain accessible only to authorised passengers?\nFootage: JharkhandRail/X\n[Indian Railways, confirmed AC ticket passengers, ticketless travellers, train overcrowding, emergency chain pulling, reserved AC coach, Indian railway passenger rights, The Logical Indian]\n#IndianRailways #TrainTravel #PassengerRights #TheLogicalIndian","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":2441.139620000058,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}